  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 pound bucatini (dry)",
    "2 cups finely grated Pecorino Romano cheese",
    "1.5 tablespoons freshly ground black pepper, or more to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e_UFcbyUx9E_wKJ9xnjqaF2QbCI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-8177-0ec3ba565c464e72ba1e5103ea538adc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and add salt. Cook bucatini in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RBnKAMtkTgU4qaTVHAJakTsb3To=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8187-f764175b38b3487f9fd9ec88dac757d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place grated Pecorino Romano cheese into a large glass bowl and mix with a fork to make sure the cheese contains no lumps.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rgt28fOhQo3gak0Mj1vbL1q1nNE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-8186-d48a9a9df6c6445da6df894c11179635.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the bucatini are al dente, lift them out with a spaghetti fork or tongs and put them directly into the bowl with the cheese. Do not allow the water to drain too much.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uDzUVGYYw7tyh-1JL4mVm5bkqUs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step4-3x4-8190-f0a6b82e53f74ed69d3bf1960fdc6ed7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add one ladle of pasta water to the bowl. Stir the bucatini around until a cream has formed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AcVjHzI7PA6i2sVCc7hsmLd4YIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-8193-d9e82b6ca6a4452886b28f90694ee799.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add more pasta water, little by little, until a thick cream has formed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BzQEhjxJXj8gVREqkbUJyLOea-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-8195-13f7354ba92b497cafbd603de46ac7c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle freshly ground pepper over the pasta. Toss and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RHmOTiIqK183FndXxfGtl18wN3s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274411-BucatiniCacioePepe-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-8198-b531039cde414fec8610c827cce986b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274411/step_07.webp"
    }
